 "description": "Turn a z, t, chi-square or F statistic into a left-, right- or two-tailed p-value, with critical values and whether it is significant at 0.05 and 0.01. Web page: https://calcbright.com/p-value-calculator",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
